# Repo-wide ignores only.
#
# The Expo app has its own app/.gitignore, shipped by the Expo template. Leave
# that file as Expo ships it so an SDK upgrade diffs cleanly (ADR-0007) — and
# note its /ios and /android entries are anchored to app/, so they cannot be
# hoisted up here without silently changing what they match.
#
# Patterns below are unanchored, so they apply recursively and act as the
# safety net for everything outside app/.

node_modules/
*.log
.DS_Store
